 DOCKER BUILD : 
 
 docker build \
  -t simple-calculator:v1 \
  -f Dockerfile \
  --no-cache .
  

Option explanation:

-t → Name and tag the image.
-f → Specify a Dockerfile if it's not named Dockerfile.
--no-cache → Rebuild every layer from scratch.
. → Build context (current directory).

